      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780365442119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "when we have function with firstletter capital, this is react component and we can use this as\n<Colors/>\nand when the first letter small, then it is a normal function and we can use like\nsum()\n\nthis helps in if we have capital letter then we can write jsx inside that. babel allow us to write\njsx inside the component only and it understand component as start with capital letter.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "when we have function with firstletter capital, this is react component and we can use this as\n<Colors/>\nand when the first letter small, then it is a normal function and we can use like\nsum()\n\nthis helps in if we have capital letter then we can write jsx inside that. babel allow us to write\njsx inside the component only and it understand component as start with capital letter.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
