      "updated": 1780390816732,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "two ways\nnamed export, default export\n\nexport default Login; -> this is default export\nexport { Home } -> this is named export\nimport Login, { Home } from './Home'\n\nif we have multiple components inside one file, then we can only make one as default export, but\nother we can export as named export\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "two ways\nnamed export, default export\n\nexport default Login; -> this is default export\nexport { Home } -> this is named export\nimport Login, { Home } from './Home'\n\nif we have multiple components inside one file, then we can only make one as default export, but\nother we can export as named export\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
