      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780367987936,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "automatically assigned values to prop when we are using component and we need to pass value inside\nthat and we are not passing that then default value is assigned to prop.\n\nconst Home = ({name = 'unknown user'}) => {\n    return (\n            <h1>Home Page</h1>,\n            <h1>Home Page1</h1>\n    )\n}\n\nexport default Home;\n\n\n<Home />\n<Home name=\"Amit\"/>",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "automatically assigned values to prop when we are using component and we need to pass value inside\nthat and we are not passing that then default value is assigned to prop.\n\nconst Home = ({name = 'unknown user'}) => {\n    return (\n            <h1>Home Page</h1>,\n            <h1>Home Page1</h1>\n    )\n}\n\nexport default Home;\n\n\n<Home />\n<Home name=\"Amit\"/>",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
