      "seed": 16858986,
      "version": 256,
      "versionNonce": 1931192054,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780368717844,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "props are immutable, we can't change these values directly, but we can change these by going\nto parent component where we are assigning value to props. where we are receiving props we can't\nchange value there.\n\n\nconst Home = ({name = 'unknown user'}) => {\n    return (\n            <h1>Home Page</h1>,\n            <h1>Home Page1</h1>\n    )\n}\n\nexport default Home;\n\n\n<Home />\n<Home name=\"Amit\"/>",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "props are immutable, we can't change these values directly, but we can change these by going\nto parent component where we are assigning value to props. where we are receiving props we can't\nchange value there.\n\n\nconst Home = ({name = 'unknown user'}) => {\n    return (\n            <h1>Home Page</h1>,\n            <h1>Home Page1</h1>\n    )\n}\n\nexport default Home;\n\n\n<Home />\n<Home name=\"Amit\"/>",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
