      "updated": 1780369720874,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Qus 17 -> useEffect interview questions\n1. Can we use multiple useEffect in a component?\n2. How to execute useEffect on a state update?\n3. What is dependency params in useEffect hook?\nuseEffect(function, dependency)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Qus 17 -> useEffect interview questions\n1. Can we use multiple useEffect in a component?\n2. How to execute useEffect on a state update?\n3. What is dependency params in useEffect hook?\nuseEffect(function, dependency)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QYMc_pCwnnMTD9Y0VfoLt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1287.5776032911454,
      "y": 90406.09950969061,
      "width": 528,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1720012714,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 382937770,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780369208480,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Can we use multiple useEffect in a component?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Can we use multiple useEffect in a component?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vXTOfkTk8Jgrat_ZMVd4r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1323.9408845411454,
      "y": 90448.20497844061,
      "width": 946,
      "height": 925,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 179609142,
      "version": 393,
      "versionNonce": 982429738,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780369699456,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "yes\n\nimport React from \"react\";\nimport { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\n\nconst Home = () => {\n    const [name, setName] = useState('amit');\n\n    useEffect(()=>{\n        console.log('useeffect one');\n    })\n\n    useEffect(()=>{\n        console.log('useeffect two');\n    })\n\n    useEffect(()=>{\n        console.log('useeffect three');\n    })\n    return (\n        <div>\n            {name ? <h1>{name}</h1> : <h1>no name</h1>}\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\nexport default Home;\n\n\nif we will not pass any dependency then it will call everytime on component rendering.\nabove will call everytime on component rendering or state change.\n\n\nuseEffect(()=>{\n        console.log('only once');\n    }, []) -> this will execute only one time\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "yes\n\nimport React from \"react\";\nimport { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";\n\nconst Home = () => {\n    const [name, setName] = useState('amit');\n\n    useEffect(()=>{\n        console.log('useeffect one');\n    })\n\n    useEffect(()=>{\n        console.log('useeffect two');\n    })\n\n    useEffect(()=>{\n        console.log('useeffect three');\n    })\n    return (\n        <div>\n            {name ? <h1>{name}</h1> : <h1>no name</h1>}\n        </div>\n    )\n}\n\nexport default Home;\n\n\nif we will not pass any dependency then it will call everytime on component rendering.\nabove will call everytime on component rendering or state change.\n\n\nuseEffect(()=>{\n        console.log('only once');\n    }, []) -> this will execute only one time\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9OwkzPT2Ir9hp8bttrfEr",
